{
  "format": "story-pages-v1",
  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-wibble-wobble-ride-v3-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "b0c062eaca5ed2c792c4be956dcde02294ed3493cbf79aebece9c8e610196867",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c57c52a1724109da57cc629b97fb8047af32dd73add5df53dafcda38b7152ca0",
      "text": "悟空的\n摇摇晃晃\n自行车",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d168036b6038f9a6fa1b4e5d70d5f7efdabfaffb35ce25be3c7abf2e5b879a3c",
      "text": "“看，他们骑得多棒！”\n悟空的尾巴“嘣”地翘起来！\n“我也想骑！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b7d7d7f06cdab84feaa4624a3a5c7493fca5de513e347358425578f0931306d2",
      "text": "悟空戴上头盔。\n“准备好啦！”\n“嗯……戴反了！”\n悟空咯咯笑。\n“再试一次！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7d6a578a9f57bc3bc119a2936ac6bcadb70f327005fe16a36d0752dd27a15f1e",
      "text": "他用脚蹬地。\n嗖，嗖，嗖。\n“看！小猴滑板车！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "09f7094f6e4ebd5c76f2b9c11830241711f5c4c649e818e9fbe5f73f0eac1b53",
      "text": "脚抬起来……\n摇呀！晃呀！\n扑通！\n“你好呀，小草。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7c0c595779702275dc7cc1a262ad5756e330539b74b52b8fee526b64a7da9eb5",
      "text": "“按按铃，也许就不晃啦。”\n叮铃！叮铃！\n铃铛倒是响了，\n车子还是晃呀晃。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "919af2751efade84f86153db7cd92b6158bcb531f7b005aea9d33285e176ec46",
      "text": "八戒扶住车座。\n“眼睛看前面，慢慢来。”\n玉兔在旁边喊：\n“你能行！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b419cb4f48cff04237449a4d859aeafe5d06420dcb7397433f2241a65c4ae97d",
      "text": "悟空又试了一次。\n蹬地，出发！\n踩一下脚踏板，\n再踩一下。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e36c1a4a6f5470581a6397d6f742740f52f37ee0121042e96931585f2f185f11",
      "text": "他往左边晃，\n尾巴往右边晃。\n“我的尾巴也在学呢！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5383d40eb045513084dffaebc044738b9e195d517ef3866f45569ec209e8c480",
      "text": "他每天都练一会儿。\n有时只能骑一小段，\n有时还是晃呀晃。\n他每天都再试一试。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f28fa96c6c1068b66582eca7193683aecd09fedb5c77d5ff47ecdcef73e368ff",
      "text": "有一天傍晚……\n八戒松开了手。\n悟空还在往前骑！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5915e10c16ca404f89b3da34f87be868ccb41991c5c4e06398feb2e5d0939c1",
      "text": "“我会骑啦！”\n他的围巾飘呀飘，\n尾巴绕了个圈。\n连耳朵都觉得好骄傲。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "08f7068855e0303535d24044986093be74dd9be1f5bc1cedf3a46d06d1dcdff0",
      "text": "他学会了转弯，\n也学会了停车——\n就停在水坑前。\n“小鸭子，你先走。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d8e188278256628365452160a795bf1fa50d3a4ddd479331061cde48b4b3558b",
      "text": "现在，他们一起骑车。\n不着急，\n轮子开开心心地转。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "72923b0ef5759ced3fb2dda2ecf435c73971a5df2df8c7b53eec038b566a6d61",
      "text": "回到家，他停好自行车。\n“晚安，轮子。”\n“晚安，摇摇晃晃。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8644cf39eb0c2efad0377985547baf28f662b3e5528d73dca583254fb215ea70",
      "text": "悟空在床上蜷成一团。\n梦里的小路平平整整，\n轮子轻轻地说：\n“嘘……”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "289f1ec520e4ee3afd619415c1cb27295d9ced81c1cf804b8ba097d89c275be2",
